// A package's module layer table, the `layers:` field of its `package.jet`:
// named layers, lowest first, each listing the modules it holds. A module
// belongs to the layer of the longest listed name it equals or sits under
// (`core.text` holds `core.text.fmt`), and may name only modules of its own
// layer or a lower one. Core's table is in Core/package.jet.
ModuleLayer: struct {
    name: String
    modules: [String]
}
